  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Installation of towing capacity to facilitate transport facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The projects objective is to be a driver of robust and sustained economic growth. One tug will be stationed in the Port of Praia (Santiago Island). The other tug will be stationed in the Port of Palmeira (Sal Island) and will also be working in the port of Sal-Rei (Boa Vista Island).The two tugs will additionally perform the following functions: - fire-fighting and oil pollution control - salvaging vessels and rescuing- ferrying pilots from and to the incoming vessels - assisting in berthing along the quays for the ports of the three islands.</narrative>
  </description>
